                <Property name="text" type="java.lang.String" value="&lt;html&gt;------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;*Each row must contain numbers from 1 to size without repetitoin.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;*Each column must contain numbers from 1 to size without repetition.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;*Their can be multiple solution to a sudoku puzzle.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;*Write down all possible entries in each empty cell.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;*The digits can only once a block.&lt;br&gt;------------------------------------------------------&#xa;&#xa;&#xa;"/>
